    "id": "c019",
    "name": "7.11(c). Other-Territory Audio-Visual Device Royalty",
    "text": "(c) With respect to Net Sales of Audio-Visual Devices sold by PRI and/or its affi liates for distribution outside of the United States and the territories referred to in paragraph 7.11(b) above, a royalty of ,.., p~r(l.,.P\")8i~l!t pereenl (~) of the lowest wholesale price, exclusive of excise, sales and similar taxes, payable by PRIls customers in respect of such Audio-Visual Device."
  },
  {
    "id": "c020",
    "name": "7.12(a). United States CD/Video Royalty",
    "text": "7.12. (a) With respect to Net Sales of Records sold by PRI for distribution in the Uni ted States in the form of CO/Videos, a royalty of twelve percent (12\\) of the CD/Video Royalty Base."
  },
  {
    "id": "c021",
    "name": "7.12(b). Foreign CD/Video Royalty",
    "text": "(b) With respect to Net Sales of Records sold by PRI and/or its affi liates for distribution outs ide the united States in the form of CD/videos, a royalty of twelve percent (12%) of the CD/Video Royalty Base multiplied by a fraction, the numerator of which is the royalty rate set forth in this agreement for Net Sales of disc Albums sold by PRI for distribution in the applicable country, and the denominator of which is the royalty rate set forth in this agreement for Net Sales of disc Albums sold by PRI for distribution in the United States."
  },
  {
    "id": "c022",
    "name": "7.12(c). CD/Video Royalty Base Definition",
    "text": "(c) The ·'CD/video Royalty Base\" shall mean the lowest wholesale price, exclusive of excise, sales L and similar taxes, payable by PRI's customers in respect 2803C/ P89-U7 CONFIDENTIAL UMG-MAL 001408 - 6 - of such CD/Video, less thirty-five percent (35\\) of such lowest wholesale price."
  },
  {
    "id": "c023",
    "name": "7.12(c). No Container Charge or Free Goods",
    "text": "No Container Charge or automatic free goods (as set forth in paragraph 13.15(a)(H) below) shall apply in respect of CD/Videos."
  },
  {
    "id": "c024",
    "name": "8. Concert Video Purchase Acknowledgment",
    "text": "8. The parties acknowledge and agree that pursuant to a separate agreement dated as of April 3, 1989, PRI shall purchase from Red Star Entertainment Co., Ltd. a \"long-form· Audio-Visual Recording embodying your concert performances in the Soviet Union during February 1989 (the \"Concert Video·)."
  },
  {
    "id": "c025",
    "name": "8(a). Satisfaction of Production Obligation",
    "text": "(a) PRI' s purchase of the Concert video shall be deemed to satisfy any obligation PRI may have pursuant to paragraph 5.02(a)(ii) of the Agreement to produce an AudiO-Visual Recording in connection 'With the first Album of the Minimum Recording Obligation for the first Option PeriOd."
  },
  {
    "id": "c026",
    "name": "8(b). Concert Video Exploitation Rights",
    "text": "(b) Notwithstanding anything to the contrary expressed or implied in paragraph 5.02(b) of the Agreement, PRI may exploit, or refrain from exploiting, the Concert Video as it deems appropriate in its sole discretion including, without limi tat ion , editing the Concert Video for promotional and/or commercial purposes and manufacturing and exploiting AudiO-Visual Devices and/or CD/Videos embodying the Concert Video or any portion thereof."
  },
  {
    "id": "c027",
    "name": "8(c). Concert Video Costs and Recoupment",
    "text": "(c) All amounts paid by PRI in connection with the Concert Video, including, without limitation, the cost of purchasing the Concert Video from Red Star Entertainment Co., Ltd., and any editing costs and/or post-production costs incurred in connection with the Concert Video, shall be deemed to be Advances under the Agreement, provided that only fifty percent (50%) of such costs shall be recoupable from audio-only Record royalties accrued to your royalty account under the Agreement."
  },
  {
