{"judgments": [
  {"clause_id": "c017", "issues": [
    {"issue": "The royalty base, \"the lowest wholesale price ... payable by PRI's customers,\" is nowhere defined and is not the \"Royalty Base\" used throughout Article 7 of the Agreement, so it is unclear whose price, at what time, and net of what discounts sets the figure. \"Lowest\" invites a reading keyed to the most favoured customer as against the ordinary published wholesale price.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.33}
  ]},
  {"clause_id": "c018", "issues": [
    {"issue": "The clause reads \"payable by PRI's customers is respect of such Audio-Visual Device,\" a mechanical error for \"in respect of.\" The enumerated territory \"Benelux\" is also left undefined, so which countries fall under (b) rather than the residual rate in 7.11(c) is not fixed by the text.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.14}
  ]},
  {"clause_id": "c019", "issues": [
    {"issue": "The royalty percentage for territories outside the United States and those listed in 7.11(b) is struck through and hand-altered, so the operative rate cannot be read from the instrument. What rate the parties agreed for the residual territories is exactly what a court would have to determine.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.48}
  ]},
  {"clause_id": "c020", "issues": [
    {"issue": "A CD/Video is defined in added 13.04(g) as a Phonograph Record in laser-read compact disc form, so it also falls within paragraph 7.04(a) of the Agreement, which gives PRI an option as to how compact disc royalties are computed, and within the 7.02 Album escalations. Which of 7.12(a) and 7.04(a)/7.02 governs sales of a CD/Video in the United States is not resolved.", "type": 2, "prob": 0.25}
  ]},
  {"clause_id": "c021", "issues": [
    {"issue": "The numerator of the fraction is \"the royalty rate set forth in this agreement for Net Sales of disc Albums sold by PRI for distribution in the applicable country,\" but paragraph 7.03 of the Agreement sets no country rates except for Japan — it fixes fractions (3/4, 2/3, 1/2) of the otherwise applicable United States rate. The denominator is likewise unstable because the United States Album rate escalates with unit sales under 7.02(b)-(e).", "type": 2, "prob": 0.30}
  ]},
  {"clause_id": "c022", "issues": [
    {"issue": "\"The lowest wholesale price, exclusive of excise, sales and similar taxes, payable by PRI's customers\" is undefined and departs from the \"Royalty Base\" mechanism used elsewhere in Article 7 of the Agreement. Whether \"lowest\" means the lowest price charged to any customer anywhere or the standard wholesale price for the configuration is left open.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.20}
